        "export_type.descr": "<xdoc><p>The type of file that will be created during export.</p><ul><li><span title=\"NEW_EDITION\">New edition</span>—A new edition of a dataset, including new information that has not been previously distributed by updates. This is the default.</li></ul></xdoc>",
